     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem SurgicalComplicationsCS</b></p><a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS\"> </a><a name=\"hcSurgicalComplicationsCS\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>https://www.cancercoreeurope.eu/fhir/core/CodeSystem/SurgicalComplicationsCS</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">N<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-N\"> </a></td><td>no</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">U<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-U\"> </a></td><td>unknown</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ABD<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-ABD\"> </a></td><td>Abscess in a drainage channel</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ABS<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-ABS\"> </a></td><td>Abscess, intra-abdominal or intrathoracic</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ASF<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-ASF\"> </a></td><td>Abscess, subfascial</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ANI<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-ANI\"> </a></td><td>Acute renal insufficiency</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">AEP<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-AEP\"> </a></td><td>Alcohol withdrawal psychosis</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ALR<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-ALR\"> </a></td><td>Allergic Reaction without Shock symptoms</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ANS<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-ANS\"> </a></td><td>Anaphylactic Shock</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">AEE<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-AEE\"> </a></td><td>Anastomotic insufficiency of an Enterostomy</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">API<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-API\"> </a></td><td>Apoplectic Stroke</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">BIF<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-BIF\"> </a></td><td>Biliary Fistula</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">BOG<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-BOG\"> </a></td><td>Bleeding, upper gastrointestinal (e.g. “stress ulcer”)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">BOE<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-BOE\"> </a></td><td>Bolus placement of an Endotube</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">BSI<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-BSI\"> </a></td><td>Bronchial Stump Insufficiency</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">CHI<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-CHI\"> </a></td><td>Cholangitis</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">DAI<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-DAI\"> </a></td><td>Intestinal Anastomosis Insufficiency</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">DPS<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-DPS\"> </a></td><td>Intestinal transit disorders (e.g. protracted atony, subileus, ileus)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">DIC<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-DIC\"> </a></td><td>Disseminated intravascular Coagulopathy</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">DEP<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-DEP\"> </a></td><td>Drug withdrawal psychosis</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">DLU<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-DLU\"> </a></td><td>Pressure and positioning damage, e.g. Decubital ulcers</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">DSI<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-DSI\"> </a></td><td>Duodenal Stump Insufficiency</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">ENF<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-ENF\"> </a></td><td>Enteral Fistula</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">GER<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-GER\"> </a></td><td>Coagulation Disorder</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">HEM<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-HEM\"> </a></td><td>Hematemesis</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">HUR<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-HUR\"> </a></td><td>Hematuria</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">HAE<a name=\"SurgicalComplicationsCS-HAE\"> </